    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17738" root="زع" body-key="z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَعْزَاعٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَعْزَعٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also [<i>Vehement motion,
agitation,</i> or <i>shaking;</i>] a subst. from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَعْزَعَهُ</span> as
signifying “ he moved it, ” &amp;c., “ vehemently: ”
and metaphorically used by Ed-Dahnà in allusion
to the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ذَكَر</span>. (TA.)

